// LLAMP-SPEC v1 | FEATURE_TASKS
// task: ADR-059 Alarm Notification Channels + Escalation Policies
// backend: T01-T10 (@sonnet) | frontend: T11-T15 (@haiku, next session)

=T01: [backend] @repo/types — add NotificationChannel + EscalationPolicy + CreateNotificationChannelBody + CreateEscalationPolicyBody interfaces; export from index.ts
=T02: [backend] notification-channel.model.ts — INotificationChannel Mongoose schema (orgId ObjectId, name string, type enum email|webhook|in-app, config Mixed, isActive bool, timestamps); export model + interface
=T03: [backend] escalation-policy.model.ts — IEscalationPolicy schema (orgId, name, alarmRuleId? ObjectId, tiers:[{delayMinutes:number, channelIds:ObjectId[], minimumSeverity:enum}], isActive, timestamps); export model + interface
=T04: [backend] alarm.model.ts — add escalatedTiers:number[] field (default []); add compound index (orgId, state, createdAt) for escalation poll query
=T05: [backend] alarm-notification.service.ts — AlarmNotificationService class; sendToChannel(channel, alarm); email path: nodemailer createTransport from config.smtp (skip if SMTP_HOST unset); webhook path: fetch with AbortController 10s; in-app path: call NotificationService.create() + broadcastNotification(); notifyOnCreate(orgId, alarm): find active channels by orgId+type:in-app, dispatch fire-and-forget
=T06: [backend] alarm-escalation.service.ts — AlarmEscalationService singleton; node-cron 60s poll; query AlarmInstance ACTIVE_UNACKED where createdAt < now-delayMinutes; for each: find EscalationPolicy (alarmRuleId match first, org wildcard fallback); for each tier not in escalatedTiers: dispatch channels via AlarmNotificationService; $push escalatedTiers; start()/stop() methods
=T07: [backend] alarm.service.ts — after createInstance() insert, call alarmNotificationService.notifyOnCreate() fire-and-forget (no await, catch logged); inject AlarmNotificationService via setNotificationService(svc) setter (avoid circular deps)
=T08: [backend] notification-channel.controller.ts + routes — 5 endpoints: POST /notification-channels, GET /notification-channels, GET /notification-channels/:id, PATCH /notification-channels/:id, DELETE /notification-channels/:id; requireAuth + Admin role; Zod validation; Swagger docs
=T09: [backend] escalation-policy.controller.ts + routes — 5 endpoints same pattern; requireAuth + Admin role; validate channelIds exist in org; Swagger docs
=T10: [backend] index.ts + config.ts + server.ts — add smtp block to config.ts (SMTP_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/FROM); add SMTP_* to .env.example; instantiate AlarmEscalationService after HeartbeatService in index.ts (start/stop teardown); setNotificationService() on AlarmService; register notification-channel + escalation-policy routes in server.ts

